[gd_resource type="StandardMaterial3D" load_steps=4 format=3]

; Repointed from a 1K albedo-plus-roughness pair to the Poly Haven 2K
; aerial_grass_rock scan with a full PBR set. The previous material had NO normal
; map, so every lawn and verge in town lit like flat painted card no matter what
; the sun was doing - a main reason the ground read as low quality. The rock
; breakup in this scan also stops the verges being a single flat green.
